              "textField": "An MAOI that is a last-resort antidepressant that is plagued with side effects is *Phenelzine* \n*Sertraline (Zoloft)* is a SSRI that is effective for panic disorder, social anxiety disorder, generalized anxiety disorder, and obsessive–compulsive disorder (OCD) \n*Amitriptyline* is a TCA that treats major depressive disorder, neuropathic pain, fibromyalgia, migraine and tension headaches.\n*Duloxetine (Cymbalta)* is an SNRI that is used to treat major depressive disorder, generalized anxiety disorder, fibromyalgia, neuropathic pain\n*Trazodone* is an atypical antidepressant which can increase libido which is opposite to most antidepressants"
